course: dictionary
lesson: 2909
title: Downward and the direction of words
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Downward tells you the way something moves or points: towards a lower place. Water runs downward, and a ball dropped from your hand moves downward.
explain: «Alice puts the Lizard in head downwards» means his head points down, towards the floor. Downward can also talk about numbers: a downward trend means the numbers are getting smaller over time.
explain: To check the meaning, read the words around downward. In «A rocket throws hot gas out downwards», the gas goes down, so the rocket is pushed up. If you swap in "down" and the sentence still makes sense, your meaning is right.
fact: Downward means moving or pointing towards a lower place.
fact: Downward can also mean going down in amount, as in «a downward trend».
fact: Downwards means the same as downward, and British English often uses downwards for the adverb.
fact: «A downward slope» is a slope that goes down, and «face downward» means facing the ground.
fact: In science, gravity pulls things downward, which is why dropped things fall.
exercise: «A rocket throws hot gas out downwards.» Which way does the gas go? | Round in a circle | Not anywhere at all | *Down, away from the rocket | Up, into the sky
exercise: What does «a downward slope» mean? | A wall built of bricks | A slope that goes up | A flat floor with no slope | *A slope that goes down
exercise: Find and copy the word that means going down in this sentence: «A wedge turns one downward blow into strong sideways pushes.» | sideways | pushes | strong | *downward
test: Ben says a downward trend means the numbers go up. Which is true? | Numbers stay exactly the same | *Numbers go down over time | Numbers go up over time | Numbers go round in circles
test: What does «face downward» mean? | Standing with your eyes closed | *Facing the floor, with your front to the ground | Lying on your back | Looking up at the ceiling
exam: «The Antipathies walk with their heads downward.» What does this tell you about them? | They have no heads at all | They are sleeping in bed | *Their heads point towards the ground | Their heads point up at the sky
